{"name":"Little Black Dress","hex":"#43484b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"little black dress","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A simply cut and often quite short evening or cocktail dress.","Something simple, versatile, and elegant; something that pairs well with many other things."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/little_black_dress"}],"entries":[{"title":"Little black dress","blocks":[{"text":"The little black dress (LBD) is a black evening or cocktail dress, cut simply and often short. Fashion historians ascribe the origins of the little black dress to the 1920s designs of Coco Chanel. It is intended to be long-lasting, versatile, affordable, and widely accessible. Its ubiquity is such that it is often simply referred to as the \"LBD\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Anneke_Gr%C3%B6nloh_1964_Eurovision_dress.jpg/330px-Anneke_Gr%C3%B6nloh_1964_Eurovision_dress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_black_dress","wikidata":"Q824385"},{"title":"Little Black Dress (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Little Black Dress is a 2011 South Korean film starring Yoon Eun-hye, Park Han-byul, Cha Ye-ryun and Yoo In-na. Based on the 2009 chick lit novel My Black Mini Dress by Kim Min-seo, the film revolves around the dreams, failures, and friendship of four 24-year-old women still looking for a direction in life."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/21/My_Black_Mini_Dress-poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Black_Dress_(film)","wikidata":"Q12594665"},{"title":"Little Black, Wisconsin","blocks":[{"text":"Little Black is a town located in Taylor County, Wisconsin, United States. The village of Stetsonville lies partly in the town, and the hamlet of Little Black. As of the 2020 census, the town had a total population of 1,156."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/WI%3B_Taylor_County_Map%3B_Town_of_Little_Black.png/330px-WI%3B_Taylor_County_Map%3B_Town_of_Little_Black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Black%2C_Wisconsin","wikidata":"Q1658973"},{"title":"Dress","blocks":[{"text":"A dress is a one-piece outer garment that is worn on the torso, hanging down over the legs. Dresses often consist of a bodice attached to a skirt."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg/330px-Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dress","wikidata":"Q200539"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG/500px-Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG/1280px-Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG/500px-Klein_zwart_jurkje.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Variations on Chanel's little black dress during the Chanel: The Legend exhibition at the Kunstmuseum in The Hague in 2014","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKlein_zwart_jurkje.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/CHANEL_little_black_dress_%286330181828%29.jpg/120px-CHANEL_little_black_dress_%286330181828%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/CHANEL_little_black_dress_%286330181828%29.jpg/250px-CHANEL_little_black_dress_%286330181828